  "components": [],
  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Three of the five icon-only controls on Sales By Representative give a screen reader a name that is not the one written down. The three-dot download button announces \"Export report\" instead of \"Report actions\"; the column button announces \"Column Selection\" instead of \"Show or hide columns\"; and the chevron at the top of the table announces \"Expand all representatives\" and \"Collapse all representatives\" instead of \"Expand all reps\" and \"Collapse all reps\"."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Environment: QA branch sv8582 (https://sv8582.qa.shopview.com), build v3.5-7168d14. Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open Reports, then Sales By Representative."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "With a screen reader or an accessibility inspector, read the name of the three-dot download button, then the column button."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Read the name of the chevron at the top of the table, both before and after using it. The named test data: sales representatives ZZAUTOTEST RepA (one invoice, S-16244) and ZZAUTOTEST RepB (three invoices, S-16243, S-16242, S-16241), plus Parth Fadadu (one invoice, S-15826); customers Aaborough Works, Aacastle Services, Aachester Partners, Aacrest Works and Beman Systems; both locations, Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 and Staging Lethbridge - 4310."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The three names above are what the controls announce. Every control works, and a screen-reader user is told something sensible \u2014 just not the agreed wording, so it does not match the rest of the suite."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "All five were checked. The per-row chevrons are correct: they announce \"Expand ZZAUTOTEST RepA\" and change to \"Collapse ZZAUTOTEST RepA\". The controls are properly keyboard operable, so this is the name only."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Each control announces the name the description gives it, word for word: \"Report actions\", \"Show or hide columns\", and \"Expand all reps\" / \"Collapse all reps\"."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Sales By Representative report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/585629698/SBR+Sales+By+Representative+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 17, requirement S18-R9: \u201cEvery icon-only control has an accessible name ... exports = \"Report actions\"; column selector = \"Show or hide columns\"; per-row chevron = \"Expand {rep name}\" / \"Collapse {rep name}\"; header chevron = \"Expand all reps\" / \"Collapse all reps\"; dialog X = \"Close\".\u201d"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
